{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "AI agent boilerplate — public API",
    "description": "The browser-facing API (auth, searches, recurring searches). Contract pinned by fixtures + zod (ADR-049).",
    "license": {
      "name": "MIT"
    },
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/api/auth/login": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Checks the password and mails a sign-in code (ADR-063).",
        "description": "Returns **202, not a session**: every sign-in takes two factors, and this\nendpoint owns only the first. `POST /api/auth/verify` finishes the job.",
        "operationId": "login",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CredentialsRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Password accepted, sign-in code sent — finish at /api/auth/verify (ADR-063)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VerificationSentResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid email or password",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "The sign-in code could not be sent",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/logout": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Revokes the refresh token and clears the cookie. Always succeeds (idempotent).",
        "operationId": "logout",
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Refresh token revoked, cookie cleared"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/password/forgot": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Mails a password-reset code (ADR-063).",
        "description": "Always 202. \"No account with that address\" is exactly the sentence that\nturns a forgot-password form into an account enumeration tool.",
        "operationId": "forgot_password",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResendVerificationRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "A reset code was sent if the address has an account",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VerificationSentResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "The reset email could not be sent",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/password/reset": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Sets a new password from a reset code and signs in (ADR-063).",
        "operationId": "reset_password",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResetPasswordRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Password changed; every other session revoked; access token in body",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AccessTokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Wrong, stale, or expired reset code",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "New password too short",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many incorrect attempts on this code",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/refresh": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Rotates the refresh cookie and returns a fresh access token (ADR-008).",
        "operationId": "refresh",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Rotated refresh cookie, new access token",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AccessTokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Missing or invalid refresh cookie",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/register": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Creates the account and mails it a verification code (ADR-062). No session\nis issued here — `POST /api/auth/verify` does that, once the address has\nanswered.",
        "operationId": "register",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CredentialsRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Account created, verification code sent",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RegistrationResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Email already registered",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Invalid credentials",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "The verification email could not be sent",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/verify": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Accepts a verification code and signs the account in (ADR-062).",
        "operationId": "verify_email",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VerifyEmailRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Address verified; access token in body, refresh token as an HttpOnly cookie",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AccessTokenResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Wrong, expired, or already-used code",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many incorrect attempts on this code",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/auth/verify/resend": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "auth"
        ],
        "summary": "Issues a fresh code, superseding any outstanding one (ADR-062).",
        "description": "Answers 202 whether or not the address is registered or already verified:\na distinguishable response would make this an account-enumeration oracle.",
        "operationId": "resend_verification",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ResendVerificationRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "A code was sent if the address needed one",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/VerificationSentResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "The verification email could not be sent",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/api/recurring": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "recurring"
        ],
        "operationId": "list_recurring",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The user's recurring searches",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RecurringView"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "recurring"
        ],
        "operationId": "create_recurring",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateRecurringRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "201": {
            "description": "Recurring scan created",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RecurringView"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Invalid wallet address or interval",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Too many recurring scans",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/recurring/{id}": {
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "recurring"
        ],
        "operationId": "delete_recurring",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "Recurring search id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Deleted"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/searches": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "searches"
        ],
        "operationId": "list_searches",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The user's searches, newest first",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "array",
                  "items": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobView"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "searches"
        ],
        "operationId": "create_search",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CreateSearchRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "202": {
            "description": "Scan launched",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobCreatedResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Invalid wallet address",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Daily quota exceeded (ADR-017)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/searches/{id}": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "searches"
        ],
        "operationId": "get_search",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "Job id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Job detail: fields, results and the agent journal",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobDetailView"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/searches/{id}/answer": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "searches"
        ],
        "summary": "The user answers the agent's clarification question (ADR-032).",
        "operationId": "answer_search",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "path",
            "description": "Job id",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "format": "uuid"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AnswerRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Answer stored; the job resumes (ADR-032)"
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "Not found",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "Job is not awaiting input",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/settings/keeperhub-key": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "settings"
        ],
        "operationId": "get_keeperhub_key",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "The connected key, or null",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "oneOf": [
                    {
                      "type": "null"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/KeeperHubKeyView"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "501": {
            "description": "Not enabled on this deployment",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "settings"
        ],
        "operationId": "put_keeperhub_key",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConnectKeeperHubRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Key stored",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/KeeperHubKeyView"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Empty or rejected key",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "501": {
            "description": "Not enabled on this deployment",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "KeeperHub unreachable",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      },
      "delete": {
        "tags": [
          "settings"
        ],
        "operationId": "delete_keeperhub_key",
        "responses": {
          "204": {
            "description": "Key removed, or there was none"
          },
          "501": {
            "description": "Not enabled on this deployment",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "bearer": []
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "AccessTokenResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`{ \"access_token\": \"…\" }` — the short-lived bearer; the refresh token is set\nas an HttpOnly cookie (ADR-008), not in the body.",
        "required": [
          "access_token"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "access_token": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "AgentStep": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "One decision of the agentic loop (ADR-030/058), recorded for the live\njournal. `kind` stays an open string (\"scan\" / \"finish\" / \"revoke\" /\n\"report\" today) so newer agents can introduce step kinds without breaking\nolder backends.",
        "required": [
          "seq",
          "kind",
          "detail",
          "reason"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "detail": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "new_hits": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "reason": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "seq": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          }
        }
      },
      "AnswerRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "answer"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "answer": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ApprovalFinding": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "chain_id",
          "token_address",
          "token_symbol",
          "spender_address",
          "approved_amount",
          "tier"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "approved_amount": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "chain_id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "explanation": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "is_new": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "False when a recurring run already saw this exact (chain, token,\nspender) approval (ADR-033); one-shot scans leave every finding new.\nDefault keeps older payloads working."
          },
          "malicious_behavior": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          },
          "raw": {},
          "revocation_status": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RevocationStatus"
          },
          "revocation_tx_hash": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "spender_address": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "spender_name": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "tier": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/RiskTier"
          },
          "token_address": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "token_symbol": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ConnectKeeperHubRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "api_key"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "api_key": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "The account's own KeeperHub API key. Validated against KeeperHub before\nit is stored, and encrypted at rest."
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateRecurringRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "wallet_address",
          "interval_minutes"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "interval_minutes": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "mode": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobMode"
          },
          "wallet_address": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "webhook_url": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "Digest target (ADR-036): notified when a run finds new results."
          }
        }
      },
      "CreateSearchRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "wallet_address"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "mode": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobMode"
          },
          "wallet_address": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "CredentialsRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "email",
          "password"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`{ \"error\": \"…\" }` — the uniform error body (ADR-018).",
        "required": [
          "error"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "error": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "JobCreatedResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`{ \"job_id\": \"…\" }` — a launched search.",
        "required": [
          "job_id"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "job_id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          }
        }
      },
      "JobDetailView": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobView"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "results",
              "steps"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "results": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApprovalFinding"
                }
              },
              "steps": {
                "type": "array",
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AgentStep"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        "description": "Full job detail: the job fields, its results, and the agent journal (ADR-030,\nempty in workflow mode). `#[serde(flatten)]` keeps the job fields at the top\nlevel, so the wire shape is identical to serving `JobView` plus the two\narrays — pinned by the contract fixture (ADR-049)."
      },
      "JobMode": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "How the scan runs (ADR-030/058): the fixed pipeline, or the agentic loop\nwhere the LLM policy decides which chains to scan, when to stop, and\n(agent mode only) auto-revokes DANGEROUS-tier approvals afterward. The\ndefault keeps pre-ADR-058 clients and payloads working unchanged.",
        "enum": [
          "workflow",
          "agent"
        ]
      },
      "JobStatus": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "pending",
          "running",
          "awaiting_input",
          "completed",
          "failed"
        ]
      },
      "JobUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "Per-run API spend (ADR-038). Accumulates across task attempts and HITL\nresumes — each attempt spends real provider credits.",
        "required": [
          "llm_calls",
          "llm_input_tokens",
          "llm_output_tokens",
          "search_calls",
          "cost_usd"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "cost_usd": {
            "type": "number",
            "format": "double"
          },
          "llm_calls": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          },
          "llm_input_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64"
          },
          "llm_output_tokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int64"
          },
          "search_calls": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32"
          }
        }
      },
      "JobView": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "wallet_address",
          "mode",
          "status",
          "usage",
          "created_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "answer": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "completed_at": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "mode": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobMode"
          },
          "question": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "recurring_search_id": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "status": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobStatus"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobUsage"
          },
          "wallet_address": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "KeeperHubKeyView": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "What the settings panel is told. Deliberately has no field that could ever\nhold the key: the type itself is the guarantee it cannot be echoed back.",
        "required": [
          "masked"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "masked": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "`••••` and the last four characters, so a person can tell which key is\nconnected without the value being recoverable."
          },
          "wallet_address": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "description": "The wallet this key executes as — the only wallet Sever can revoke for\non this account (ADR-065)."
          }
        }
      },
      "RecurringView": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "wallet_address",
          "mode",
          "interval_minutes",
          "created_at"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "created_at": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "interval_minutes": {
            "type": "integer",
            "format": "int32",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "last_run_at": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ],
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "mode": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/JobMode"
          },
          "wallet_address": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "webhook_url": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "RegistrationResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "A created account (ADR-062). `verification_required` is always true: the\naccount exists but cannot be signed into until the emailed code is entered,\nand the client uses this to move straight to the code screen.\n\n`verification_code` is present **only** in a development configuration with\nno email provider, so the console can be driven without a mailbox. It is\nabsent in production, where `AppConfig` refuses to expose it.",
        "required": [
          "id",
          "email",
          "verification_required"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "verification_code": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          },
          "verification_required": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        }
      },
      "ResendVerificationRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`{ \"email\": \"…\" }` — \"send me another code\", and \"I forgot my password\".",
        "required": [
          "email"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ResetPasswordRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`{ \"email\": \"…\", \"code\": \"123456\", \"password\": \"…\" }` — account recovery.",
        "required": [
          "email",
          "code",
          "password"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "password": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "RevocationStatus": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "What happened when a DANGEROUS-tier approval was sent for revocation\n(ADR-058).\n\n`Revoked` means a transaction was broadcast and confirmed onchain, with\n`revocation_tx_hash` to prove it. A dry run is `Simulated`, never\n`Revoked` — the UI must never show a still-live approval as neutralized.",
        "enum": [
          "not_attempted",
          "pending",
          "simulated",
          "revoked",
          "failed"
        ]
      },
      "RiskTier": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "How dangerous an outstanding approval is judged to be (ADR-058).\n\nDeliberately a closed, deterministic vocabulary rather than a free-form\nLLM score: the agent's `classify_risk` (not an LLM) assigns the tier from\nverified threat-intel signals, and the tier alone decides whether an\napproval is auto-revoked or left for the user. The backend never assigns\nor changes a tier — it only stores and re-serves what the agent decided.",
        "enum": [
          "safe",
          "watch",
          "dangerous"
        ]
      },
      "VerificationSentResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "The answer to \"send me a code\".\n\nCarries no claim that anything was sent — it cannot, because the request is\nanswered identically for an unregistered address and an already-verified\none, and saying `sent: true` there would be a field that lies. The client's\nwording is conditional to match (\"if that address needs a code…\").",
        "properties": {
          "verification_code": {
            "type": [
              "string",
              "null"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "VerifyEmailRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "description": "`{ \"email\": \"…\", \"code\": \"123456\" }` — answering a verification code.",
        "required": [
          "email",
          "code"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "email": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "bearer": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "JWT"
      }
    }
  },
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "auth",
      "description": "Registration, login, session refresh (ADR-008)"
    },
    {
      "name": "searches",
      "description": "Launch and read approval scans (ADR-030/032/058)"
    },
    {
      "name": "recurring",
      "description": "Scheduled recurring scans (ADR-033)"
    }
  ]
}
